# Sandbox

Python package `terrarium_sandbox`.

- One container per session, CPU/memory/PID/network limits
- Preview URL via Traefik: `{sessionId}.sandbox.local` (or configured host)
- Emit `sandbox.booting`, `sandbox.ready`, `sandbox.unhealthy`
- Never run generated apps on the API host
- Idle sleep stops the container; wake starts it again
- Do not call LLMs from this package
